//? Title: Secant roots: actual proposals, queries and explicit failure stops
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Find a scalar root from two starting points using the secant line. Actual native
callbacks distinguish evaluated candidates from failed proposals; the original x
squared minus two experiment starts at one and two.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

Linear interpolation of the two retained function values gives
$$ x_{k+1}=x_k-f(x_k)\frac{x_k-x_{k-1}}{f(x_k)-f(x_{k-1})}. $$
\alttext(The next secant estimate is the latest point minus its residual times the secant slope inverse.)
For a simple sufficiently regular root and suitable starting points the local
convergence order is the golden ratio. This unbracketed iteration has no global
guarantee. The implementation normalizes the residual pair before forming a
widened proposal and reports horizontal denominators, arithmetic range,
stagnation and budget exhaustion separately. Only an actual residual success
sets converged.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/secant_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <bit>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/secant.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::secant_trace([](double x) { return x * x - 2; }, 1, 2);
    std::print("| actual correction | previous | current | proposed | queried | residual (0 sentinel if " "unqueried) |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | ---: |\n");
    for (std::size_t i = 0; i < r.steps.size(); ++i) {
        const auto &s = r.steps[i];
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", i, s.previous,
                   s.current, s.proposal, s.evaluated, s.value);
    }
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Query x=1 and x=2");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("Actual proposals {}", r.proposals));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Residual success {}", r.result.converged));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/secant_tiny.svg");
}
```
